#ASSERT `the state pension credit I am entitled to` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 22) Woman (YearMonthDay 1950 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE Man (YearMonthDay 1949 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2014 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2009 3 1) FALSE 0 0 100 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 100 0 0 120 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 120 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 300 200 50 40 0 FALSE 0 150 50 50 60 FALSE 0 FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 115
