#ASSERT `whether I meet the age condition for the savings credit` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 22) Woman (YearMonthDay 1950 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE Man (YearMonthDay 1949 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2014 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2009 3 1)

