#ASSERT `whether the savings credit can be refused me as a member of a mixed-age couple` Woman (YearMonthDay 1950 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) (YearMonthDay 2010 5 10) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE Man (YearMonthDay 1958 1 1) (YearMonthDay 2023 1 1) (YearMonthDay 2018 1 1) TRUE
